<view class="page intro-page safe-top">
  <view class="content intro-content">
    <view class="hero">
      <view class="hero-rings">
        <view class="ring ring-a"></view>
        <view class="ring ring-b"></view>
        <ghost-logo size="{{170}}" glow="{{true}}" />
      </view>
      <text class="hero-title brand-title">GHOST ALBUM</text>
      <view class="hero-subtitle">
        <view></view>
        <text>幽灵相册</text>
        <view></view>
      </view>
      <text class="hero-copy">把私密照片和视频藏进只属于你的本地相册</text>
    </view>

    <view class="intro-card card">
      <view class="section-head">
        <text class="section-kicker mono">HIGHLIGHTS</text>
      </view>
      <view class="feature-list">
        <view class="feature-item">
          <view class="feature-dot"></view>
          <view>
            <text class="feature-title">无需上传云端</text>
            <text class="feature-desc">照片、视频只保存到本机微信小程序沙盒内。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="feature-item">
          <view class="feature-dot cyan"></view>
          <view>
            <text class="feature-title">不出现在系统相册</text>
            <text class="feature-desc">适合收纳不希望被系统相册直接看到的内容。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="feature-item">
          <view class="feature-dot"></view>
          <view>
            <text class="feature-title">本地密码保护</text>
            <text class="feature-desc">首次设置密码，之后进入小程序需要先解锁。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="feature-item">
          <view class="feature-dot cyan"></view>
          <view>
            <text class="feature-title">多入口导入</text>
            <text class="feature-desc">支持从系统相册和微信聊天中选择照片、视频。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="intro-card risk-card">
      <view class="section-head">
        <text class="section-kicker mono">LIMITATIONS</text>
      </view>
      <view class="risk-list">
        <text>清除小程序、清理微信缓存、卸载微信或更换设备，可能导致数据永久丢失。</text>
        <text>不提供云备份、跨设备同步、密码找回能力。</text>
        <text>为了保护隐私，请在导入前自行确认重要文件已有其他备份。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="primary-button start-button" bindtap="openPasswordModal">开始使用</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{showPasswordModal}}" class="modal-mask">
    <view class="modal-card password-modal">
      <view class="modal-header">
        <view>
          <text class="modal-kicker mono">SET PASSWORD</text>
          <text class="modal-title">设置本地密码</text>
        </view>
        <button class="icon-button" bindtap="closePasswordModal">
          <text class="icon-close"></text>
        </button>
      </view>
      <text class="modal-copy">密码只用于本机解锁。忘记密码后无法找回，只能清除小程序数据重新开始。</text>
      <input class="field" password="{{true}}" maxlength="32" placeholder="输入密码" placeholder-class="placeholder" bindinput="onPasswordInput" value="{{password}}" />
      <input class="field" password="{{true}}" maxlength="32" placeholder="再次输入密码" placeholder-class="placeholder" bindinput="onConfirmInput" bindconfirm="submitPassword" value="{{confirmPassword}}" />
      <text wx:if="{{errorText}}" class="error-text">{{errorText}}</text>
      <button class="primary-button modal-submit" bindtap="submitPassword">保存并进入</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{showDecoyModal}}" class="modal-mask">
    <view class="modal-card password-modal">
      <view class="modal-header">
        <view>
          <text class="modal-kicker mono">DECOY MODE</text>
          <text class="modal-title">伪装模式（可选）</text>
        </view>
        <button class="icon-button" bindtap="closeDecoyModal">
          <text class="icon-close"></text>
        </button>
      </view>
      <text class="modal-copy">设置一个伪装密码。当他人要求查看相册时，输入伪装密码只会展示你预设的安全内容，真正的私密照片不会暴露。
主密码和伪装密码共享同一个解锁页面。</text>
      <input class="field" password="{{true}}" maxlength="32" placeholder="设置伪装密码" placeholder-class="placeholder" bindinput="onDecoyPasswordInput" value="{{decoyPassword}}" />
      <input class="field" password="{{true}}" maxlength="32" placeholder="再次输入伪装密码" placeholder-class="placeholder" bindinput="onDecoyConfirmInput" bindconfirm="submitDecoyPassword" value="{{decoyConfirm}}" />
      <text wx:if="{{decoyErrorText}}" class="error-text">{{decoyErrorText}}</text>
      <button class="primary-button modal-submit" bindtap="submitDecoyPassword">启用伪装模式</button>
      <button class="ghost-button modal-link" bindtap="skipDecoyPassword">暂不设置，直接进入</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
